### SLIDE 11 — COMPLETE TECHNOLOGY STACK
**Title:** The Complete Stack — Every Layer Engineered  

| Layer | Technologies |
|---|---|
| AI / ML | Python 3.10+, YOLOv8 (Pose + Detection), OpenCV, NumPy |
