| Security | X-API-Key M2M Auth, JWT Sessions, Audit Logging, bcrypt |

---

### SLIDE 12 — DEVOPS & DOCKER ORCHESTRATION
**Title:** DevOps — Containerized, Orchestrated, Production-Ready  

Architecture highlights:
- Single `docker-compose.yml` with 10 named services and Docker Compose profiles
- Profile-based selective startup: launch any 1, 2, 3, or all 4 platforms
- Automatic `.env` generation from `.env.example` on first run
- Docker healthcheck probes on all services before dependent services start
- Named Docker volumes for persistent data across container restarts
- All services communicate over isolated `safesight-network` bridge
- GitHub Actions workflow for automated CI/CD audit and validation

---

### SLIDE 13 — SECURITY ARCHITECTURE
**Title:** Security — Layered, Audited, Production-Grade  

| Layer | Implementation |
|---|---|
| Machine Auth | AI nodes authenticate via UUID X-API-Key headers |
| User Auth | JWT-signed tokens with configurable expiry |
| Password Security | bcrypt hashing (salt rounds configurable) |
| Audit Trail | Every login, API call, and alert logged in MongoDB |
| Network Isolation | All services on isolated safesight-network Docker bridge |
| Secrets Management | .env file (gitignored) — never hard-coded in images |
| Environment Safety | .env.example template — zero secrets in repository |

