### SLIDE 17 — MLOps PIPELINE
**Title:** MLOps — From Model to Production  

Highlight the MLOps workflow:
- Pre-trained YOLOv8n-pose weights (6.5 MB, no GPU needed)
- Threshold calibration system (AR ratio, confirm frames, fall duration)
- Synthetic test frame injection for CI/CD accuracy validation
- 56-test regression suite runs on every commit via GitHub Actions
- Accuracy targets enforced: Precision ≥ 80%, Recall ≥ 80%, F1 ≥ 80%
- Camera benchmark tests validate FPS performance and pipeline throughput
- Model upgrade path: swap `.pt` file, re-calibrate thresholds, re-run tests

